o latex 751 - use neat.","s":{"t":"PDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/k/schoenox_ab.pdf","v":"October 2025, Version 01.08","p":2,"sec":"Application Information"}},{"id":"schoenox-ab:mix_ratio:445f07a9","label":"Mixing ratio","text":"Trowel size 2.6mm V notched trowel for board substrates","s":{"t":"PDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/k/schoenox_ab.pdf","v":"October 2025, Version 01.08","p":2,"sec":"Application Information"}},{"id":"schoenox-ab:mix_ratio:d639def1","label":"Mixing ratio","text":"Trowel size 3.5mm V notched trowel for concrete and screed susbstrates","s":{"t":"PDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/k/schoenox_ab.pdf","v":"October 2025, Version 01.08","p":2,"sec":"Application Information"}},{"id":"schoenox-ab:mix_ratio:81b99823","label":"Mixing ratio","text":"1.5 hours (approx)","s":{"t":"PDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/k/schoenox_ab.pdf","v":"October 2025, Version 01.08","p":2,"sec":"Application Information"}},{"id":"schoenox-ab:mix_ratio:f076ef1b","label":"Mixing ratio","text":"Add the Lanko latex 751 additive to a clean mixing bucket.","s":{"t":"PDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/k/schoenox_ab.pdf","v":"October 2025, Version 01.08","p":2,"sec":"Application Information"}},{"id":"schoenox-ab:mix_ratio:cd4728b2","label":"Mixing ratio","text":"Slowly add the SikaTile 440 Opti-Cure to the bucket while stirring with an electric mixing drill.","s":{"t":"PDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/k/schoenox_ab.pdf","v":"October 2025, Version 01.08","p":2,"sec":"Application Information"}},{"id":"schoenox-ab:mix_ratio:4f445f12","label":"Mixing ratio","text":"Mix the adhesive to a smooth lump free mixture and allow the mixture to stand or \"slake\" for 3 minutes.","s":{"t":"PDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/k/schoenox_ab.pdf","v":"October 2025, Version 01.08","p":2,"sec":"Application Information"}},{"id":"schoenox-ab:mix_ratio:ea68b0b3","label":"Mixing 